Z||000019||FieroJoe||06-18-2001||10:36 PM||||Thanks Tigger!!<P>Also, I belive I have read before that only 4,434 Fieros were blue from the factory.<P>Also, last year I saw a blue 87 coupe while driving mine, and we both looked at each other in amazement as I drove by.<P>Also, and unfortunatly, there is another blue coupe that's been driving around the town(so I have heard, only saw this one once, and real late at night), that has white racing stripes, a rear wing, and GT badging.<P>Even though it was a decimation of a blue coupe, it still wasnt as bad as the black SE that I saw today.  Besides the chrome exhaust tip that stuck out like a sore thumb, the shoddy paint, headlights that wont go down, and all the black molding covered in that stick-on chrome tape, this car also had 13" chrome rims that stuck out a litte.  I about cried so hard, such a waste of what could be a really nice car!!<P>I wish I had my camera.||||reg||1
